{"book":"Proverbs","chapters":[{"chapter":"1","sections":[{"verses":"","text":"Book Introduction - Proverbs\n\nThis collection of sententious sayings is divine wisdom applied to the earthly conditions of the people of God. That the Proverbs were Solomon's (Proverbs 1:1) implies no more than that he gathered into orderly arrangement sayings already current amongst the people, the wisdom of the Spirit, perhaps through many centuries (Ecclesiastes 12:9). Chapters 25-29 were current in Hezekiah's time (Ecclesiastes 25:1). Chapters 30 and 31 are by Agur and Lemuel.\n\nThe book is in six parts:\n\nTo sons, 1-7. The praise of wisdom, 8-9. The folly of sin, 10-19. Warnings and instructions, 20-29. The words of Agur, 30. The words of King Lemuel, 31."},{"verses":"7","text":"fear\n\nAlso; Proverbs 1:29, (See Scofield \"Psalms 19:9\")"},{"verses":"12","text":"grave\n\nHeb. \"Sheol,\" (See Scofield \"Habakkuk 2:5\")."},{"verses":"29","text":"fear\n\nAlso; Proverbs 1:7. (See Scofield \"Psalms 19:9\")."}]},{"chapter":"2","sections":[{"verses":"5","text":"fear\n\nAlso; Proverbs 3:7, (See Scofield \"Psalms 19:9\")."},{"verses":"21","text":"perfect\n\n(See Scofield \"1 Kings 8:61\")."}]},{"chapter":"3","sections":[{"verses":"5","text":"trust\n\n(See Scofield \"Psalms 2:12\")"},{"verses":"7","text":"fear\n\nAlso; Proverbs 2:5 (See Scofield \"Psalms 19:9\")"}]},{"chapter":"5","sections":[{"verses":"5","text":"hell\n\nHeb. \"Sheol,\" (See Scofield \"Habakkuk 2:5\")"}]},{"chapter":"7","sections":[{"verses":"","text":"hell\n\nHeb. \"Sheol,\" (See Scofield \"Habakkuk 2:5\")"}]},{"chapter":"8","sections":[{"verses":"1","text":"hell\n\nHeb. \"Sheol,\" (See Scofield \"Habakkuk 2:5\")"},{"verses":"13","text":"fear\n\n(See Scofield \"Psalms 19:9\")"},{"verses":"22","text":"The Lord possessed me\n\nThat wisdom is more than the personification of an attribute of God, or of the will of God as best for man, but is a distinct adumbration of Christ, is sure to the devout mind. Proverbs 8:22-36; John 1:1-3; Colossians 1:17 can refer to nothing less than the Eternal Son of God."}]},{"chapter":"9","sections":[{"verses":"10","text":"fear\n\n(See Scofield \"Psalms 19:9\")"},{"verses":"","text":"hell\n\nHeb. \"Sheol,\" (See Scofield \"Habakkuk 2:5\")"}]},{"chapter":"10","sections":[{"verses":"1","text":"foolish son\n\nA \"fool\" in Scripture is never a mentally deficient person, but rather one arrogant and self-sufficient; one who orders his life as if there were no God. See, for illustration, Luke 12:16-20. The rich man was not mentally deficient, but he was a \"fool\" because he supposed that his soul could live on the things in the barn, giving no thought to his eternal wellbeing."},{"verses":"27","text":"fear\n\n(See Scofield \"Psalms 19:9\")"}]},{"chapter":"11","sections":[{"verses":"5","text":"perfect\n\n(See Scofield \"1 Kings 8:61\")."},{"verses":"25","text":"liberal soul\n\nSee; 2 Corinthians 9:6-10."},{"verses":"28","text":"trusteth\n\n(See Scofield \"Psalms 2:12\")."}]},{"chapter":"14","sections":[{"verses":"2","text":"feareth\n\n(See Scofield \"Psalms 19:9\")."},{"verses":"26","text":"fear\n\nAlso; Proverbs 15:16, (See Scofield \"Psalms 19:9\")."},{"verses":"27","text":"fear\n\n(See Scofield \"Psalms 19:9\")."}]},{"chapter":"15","sections":[{"verses":"11","text":"hell\n\nHeb. \"Sheol,\" (See Scofield \"Habakkuk 2:5\") , Job 26:6; Psalms 139:8."},{"verses":"16","text":"fear\n\nAlso; Proverbs 14:26, (See Scofield \"Psalms 19:9\")."},{"verses":"24","text":"hell\n\nHeb. \"Sheol,\" (See Scofield \"Habakkuk 2:5\")"},{"verses":"","text":"fear\n\n(See Scofield \"Psalms 19:9\")."}]},{"chapter":"16","sections":[{"verses":"1","text":"fear\n\n(See Scofield \"Psalms 19:9\")."},{"verses":"20","text":"trusteth\n\n(See Scofield \"Psalms 2:12\")."}]},{"chapter":"19","sections":[{"verses":"23","text":"fear\n\n(See Scofield \"Psalms 19:9\")."}]},{"chapter":"22","sections":[{"verses":"4","text":"fear\n\n(See Scofield \"Psalms 19:9\")."},{"verses":"6","text":"train up a child\n\nSee, Ephesians 6:4; 2 Timothy 3:15."},{"verses":"19","text":"trust\n\n(See Scofield \"Psalms 2:12\")."}]},{"chapter":"23","sections":[{"verses":"11","text":"redeemer\n\nHeb. \"goel,\" Redemp. (Kinsman type). (See Scofield \"Isaiah 59:20\")."},{"verses":"14","text":"hell\n\nHeb. \"Sheol,\" (See Scofield \"Habakkuk 2:5\")."},{"verses":"17","text":"fear\n\n(See Scofield \"Psalms 19:9\")."}]},{"chapter":"24","sections":[{"verses":"21","text":"fear\n\n(See Scofield \"Psalms 19:9\")"}]},{"chapter":"27","sections":[{"verses":"20","text":"grave\n\nAlso; Proverbs 30:16, Heb. \"Sheol,\" (See Scofield \"Habakkuk 2:5\")."}]},{"chapter":"28","sections":[{"verses":"25","text":"trust\n\n(See Scofield \"Psalms 2:12\") , Also; Proverbs 29:25."}]},{"chapter":"30","sections":[{"verses":"5","text":"trust\n\n(See Scofield \"Psalms 2:12\")."},{"verses":"16","text":"grave\n\nHeb. \"Sheol,\" (See Scofield \"Habakkuk 2:5\")."}]},{"chapter":"31","sections":[{"verses":"11","text":"trust\n\n(See Scofield \"Psalms 2:12\")."},{"verses":"30","text":"feareth\n\n(See Scofield \"Psalms 19:9\")"}]}]}